Categoria Energética: A+

We present this excellent 1-bedroom apartment in Maximinos, Braga, with 71.2 m² of gross floor area, located on the 2nd floor of a building currently undergoing a complete renovation, with particular attention to the quality of the materials, comfort and energy efficiency.

With a privileged location, the apartment is close to Braga's historic city centre, the railway station, public transport, schools, shops and services, combining the convenience of a central location with high-quality renovation and modern standards.

 Spaces designed for comfort

The apartment comprises:

1 bedroom with en-suite bathroom;

Spacious living room with kitchen area;

Second bathroom;

Balcony accessible from both the living room and bedroom;

Built-in wardrobes in white lacquered MDF;

Oak parquet flooring with a matt finish;

Suspended plasterboard ceilings with recessed features and integrated LED lighting.

 High-quality kitchen and finishes

The kitchen features lacquered cabinetry, an Absolut Blanc compact quartz worktop, a single-bowl ceramic sink and extractor hood.

The bathrooms feature white, rectified semi-gloss porcelain tiles, complemented by sanitary ware and taps from renowned brands such as Bruma, Sanitana and Sanindusa.

 Comfort and energy efficiency

The renovation includes solutions designed to provide excellent thermal and acoustic comfort, including:

Thermal and acoustic insulation using sprayed polyurethane and mineral wool;

Black lacquered aluminium window frames;

Double glazing;

ETICS external thermal insulation system;

Air conditioning;

A+ energy rating.

 Parking space included

The apartment includes one private parking space in the price, a valuable advantage in such a central location.

 Completion scheduled for the end of 2026

The renovation works are currently underway and are expected to be completed by the end of 2026. Handover is scheduled for early 2027, with the corresponding occupancy/use licence.

An excellent opportunity for those looking for an apartment with contemporary design, high-quality finishes, energy efficiency, a balcony and parking, in a central and sought-after area of Braga.

